ion and whether they have data  on what's happening in their supply  chain because on all of these topics  deforestation water and climate change  the vast majority of the impact is  actually in the supply chain of a lot of  these major organizations so  these 14 organizations will be showing  that they are reducing their impact uh  in their own operations but critically  also  engaging with suppliers to reduce their  impact and reducing the impact of their  pro product portfolio  downstream as well  dexter can sustainability efforts be  allocated  to certain regions countries  or economic sectors  well there's certain um in our a-list  this year we have some clear leading  comp countries so for example  asia and europe are the regions that  have performed the best in the world  this year and japan is definitely  leading the pack in asia if we look into  europe we've got 23 french companies on  the a-list and they're the leaders in  europe followed by  the uh the british the uk  at 15 and then germany at 14.  why is it that these uh  regions these countries and the  companies stemming from there are at the  forefront  i think it's a mixture of  policy  environment these countries tend to have  um  quite advanced uh initiatives at the the  government level um some good policy  structure um clear signaling from the  government that  that this is only going one way that  that the country is going in the  direction of net zero all of those  countries have clear and net zero  targets at a national level um i also  think consumer pressure particularly in  france the uk and germany is a big  driver of corporate action on this issue  and of course  those countries have quite advanced  finance sectors and in the last couple  of years we've seen an explosion of  interest in esg as we call it  environmental social governance data  there's literally trillions of dollars  sloshing around in the esg space these  days that's really helping to drive  corporate action and those companies  that are taking action and getting into  our a-list are actually receiving a  large bulk of that cash  so they're actually being rewarded by  the markets  dexter gavin global director  corporations and supply chains at cdp  dexter thank you
 

